# Local handoff/handover artifacts — session/PC transfer notes are never source.
# Only basenames that START with handoff/handover are global. Topic-prefixed
# local notes belong under already-ignored .agents/work|progress|reviews or dirs below.
**/.handoff/
**/.handover/
**/[Hh][Aa][Nn][Dd][Oo][Ff][Ff]*.[Mm][Dd]
**/[Hh][Aa][Nn][Dd][Oo][Ff][Ff]*.[Tt][Xx][Tt]
**/[Hh][Aa][Nn][Dd][Oo][Ff][Ff]*.[Jj][Ss][Oo][Nn]
**/[Hh][Aa][Nn][Dd][Oo][Ff][Ff]*.[Yy][Aa][Mm][Ll]
**/[Hh][Aa][Nn][Dd][Oo][Ff][Ff]*.[Yy][Mm][Ll]
**/[Hh][Aa][Nn][Dd][Oo][Vv][Ee][Rr]*.[Mm][Dd]
**/[Hh][Aa][Nn][Dd][Oo][Vv][Ee][Rr]*.[Tt][Xx][Tt]
**/[Hh][Aa][Nn][Dd][Oo][Vv][Ee][Rr]*.[Jj][Ss][Oo][Nn]
**/[Hh][Aa][Nn][Dd][Oo][Vv][Ee][Rr]*.[Yy][Aa][Mm][Ll]
**/[Hh][Aa][Nn][Dd][Oo][Vv][Ee][Rr]*.[Yy][Mm][Ll]
